          "text": "⟪ወነበርነ ፡ ኀቤሆሙ ፡ አሐተ ፡ ዕለተ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 2,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ከነሱ ፡ ዘንድ ፡ አንድ ፡ ቀን ፡ አደርነ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 3,
          "margin_tag": "፰",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "፰ ፤ ⟪ወበሳኒታ ፡ ወፃእነ ፡ ወሖርነ ፡ ቂሣርያ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 4,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "በነጋውም ፡ ከዚያ ፡ ወጥተን ፡ ወደ ፡ ቂሣ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 5,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ርያ ፡ ሄድነ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 6,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወቦእነ ፡ ቤተ ፡ ፊልጶስ ፡ ዜናዊ ፡ አሐዱ ፡ እምሰብዐቱ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 7,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "አኀው ፡ ዲያቆናት ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 8,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ከሰባቱ ፡ ዲያቆናት ፡ አንዱ ፡ ወንጌልን ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 9,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ከሚያስተምር ፡ ከፊልጶስ ፡ ቤት ፡ ገባን ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 10,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ም ፡ ፰ ፥ ፵ ።",
